CM_ "Current/SOC decode v27. Long-log cleanup: source Manager30 and Battery Sensor currents are 32-bit little-endian values centred at exactly 1,000,000. Formula is raw/1000 - 1000. Redvision display copies are 16-bit values centred at exactly 10,000. Formula is raw/10 - 1000.";

CM_ BU_ Manager30 "Source address 0x01.";
CM_ BU_ Battery_Sensor "Source address 0x08.";
