CM_ BO_ 2399144186 "CONFIRMED_CORRECT_DO_NOT_EDIT: Battery config write from source 0xFA to Battery_Sensor destination 0x08. Raw CAN ID 0x0F0008FA. D1 is command/mux; D1=0x11 writes battery type, D1=0x12 writes configured capacity Ah, D1=0x14 writes max charge current A, D1=0x15 calibrates/sets SOC target %, D1=0x41 writes low SOC alarm %, D1=0x42 writes low voltage alarm V.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_Command "D1 command/mux. 0x11 = battery type, 0x12 = configured capacity, 0x14 = max charge current, 0x15 = SOC calibration target, 0x41 = low SOC alarm, 0x42 = low voltage alarm.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_Item "D3 observed 0x03 for these battery config writes.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_Capacity_Ah "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned Ah. Controlled sequence captured: 450 Ah, 400 Ah, 350 Ah, 400 Ah.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_BatteryType "D5-D6 little-endian battery type. Confirmed from battery type change 5 times.csv sequence: 0=Gel, 1=AGM, 2=LeadAcid, 3=Calcium, 4=Lithium.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_MaxChargeCurrent_A "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned A. Controlled sequence captured and corrected by user: 20 A, 14 A, 10 A, 30 A.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_SOCCalibrationTarget_Percent "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned percent. calibrate battery start of charge full 5 times.csv captured five repeats of D1=0x15, D5-D6=0x0064, calibrating/setting battery SOC to 100%.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_LowSOCAlarm_Percent "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned percent. Confirmed sequence from more battery config.csv: 10%, 15%, 20%, 30%.";
CM_ SG_ 2399144186 BatteryConfigWrite_LowVoltageAlarm_V "D5-D6 little-endian millivolts, scale 0.001 V/count. Confirmed sequence from more battery config.csv: 10.0 V, 11.0 V, 11.5 V, 12.0 V.";
VAL_ 2482044936 Battery_Type 0 "Gel" 1 "AGM" 2 "LeadAcid" 3 "Calcium" 4 "Lithium" ;
