CM_ BO_ 2399207200 "CONFIRMED_CORRECT_DO_NOT_EDIT: Redvision Display 1 local setting-change broadcast. Raw CAN ID 0x0F00FF20, source 0x20. Payload pattern <setting> 00 FF FF <value little-endian> 00 00. battery changes from redvision.csv shows the same setting IDs and value encoding as Bluetooth/config-tool changes.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_Command "D1 setting/mux. 0x11 = battery type, 0x12 = configured capacity, 0x14 = max charge current, 0x41 = low SOC alarm, 0x42 = low voltage alarm, 0x43 = Manager30 charging mode, 0x4D = charge-cycle/stage request candidate, 0x68 = vehicle input trigger.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_D3 "D3 observed 0xFF for these Redvision setting broadcasts.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_D4 "D4 observed 0xFF for these Redvision setting broadcasts.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_BatteryType "D5-D6 little-endian battery type. Confirmed examples: 2=LeadAcid, 0=Gel, 4=Lithium.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_Capacity_Ah "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned Ah. Confirmed examples: 0x0177=375 Ah, 0x0154=340 Ah, 0x0190=400 Ah.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_MaxChargeCurrent_A "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned A. Confirmed example: 0x001E=30 A.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_LowSOCAlarm_Percent "D5-D6 little-endian unsigned percent. Confirmed example: 0x001E=30%.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_LowVoltageAlarm_V "D5-D6 little-endian millivolts, scale 0.001 V/count. Confirmed example: 0x2EE0=12.0 V.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_ChargingMode "CONFIRMED_CORRECT_DO_NOT_EDIT: D1=0x43 Manager30 charging mode command. D5=0x00 Touring, D5=0x01 Storage. Observed RedVision source 0x20 sends 43 00 FF FF <mode> 00 00 00.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_ChargeCycleRequest_Candidate "PARTLY_CONFIRMED: D1=0x4D charge-cycle/stage request candidate. Observed 4D 00 FF FF 01 00 00 00 before later Float->Boost transition, but it did not immediately change live stage status.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_VehicleInputTrigger "D5-D6 little-endian trigger value. Confirmed examples: 0=Auto, 1=12V, 3=Ignition.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_D7 "D7 observed 0x00 for these Redvision setting broadcasts.";
CM_ SG_ 2399207200 RedvisionConfigBroadcast_D8 "D8 observed 0x00 for these Redvision setting broadcasts.";
