CM_ "v30 update: added confirmed TVMS_1280 Tank1 level on 0x1BFD0224 MUX 0x14 D4, raw percent.";

CM_ "v31 TVMS1280 water 1-6 review: only one clean raw 25%/0% tank-level field was found in the uploaded log: raw CAN ID 0x1BFD0224, MUX 0x14, D4 = TVMS1280_Tank1_Percent. No separate confirmed 25/0 raw percent fields for TVMS1280 tanks 2-6 were visible in this capture, so they were not added as confirmed signals.";
CM_ "TVMS1280 Tank1 validation from TVMS1280 water 1-6.csv: log starts with Tank1 at 25%, later D4 changes to 0%, and ends with Tank1 back at 25%.";

CM_ "v32 TVMS1280 Tank2 review: 1280 tank 2 100-0.csv was inspected. No source address 0x24 field showed a clean 100% to 0% raw-percent change, so TVMS1280_Tank2_Percent was not added as a confirmed signal.";
CM_ "v32 observed 0x24 frames: 0x1BFD0224 cycles mux 0x11/0x14/0x17/0x1A; mux 0x14 D4, previously confirmed Tank1, remained 0 in this capture. 0x1BFD0024 and other source 0x24 frames were static/status-like and did not carry a 100 to 0 percent value.";


