CM_ "v51 update: merged latest reverse-engineering results from ESPHome/log work: Manager30 solar Wh confirmed as 0x03FCD601 D1=0x00 D2-D5 uint32 Wh; Rouge 1BFD1230 level feedback corrected to base-channel grouped byte layout; Rouge 1BFD1430 identified as hardware button/dimming-active status; Rouge 1BFD0030 documented as coarse status; TVMS1280 1BFD0024 documented as output feedback; module input voltage frames 13F10830/13F10824 added.";
CM_ "v52 update: TVMS1280 hardware has 3 digital inputs. They are currently unused in this installation and no confirmed CAN PGN/byte decode has been identified. Do not confuse them with TVMS Rouge hardware button/dimming-active status 0x1BFD1430. Candidate TVMS1280 status/input frames to test: 0x1BFD0224, 0x1BFCF024, 0x1BFCF224, 0x13F10824.";

